WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.110
Will we make it?

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:06.540
Don't worry! I'm sure she's in the top three!

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:17.990
I can't find her.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:22.360
Where did she go?

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.620
Whoa, Yotsuba secures the 
zone in her first try!

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.010
You can always count on her!

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:32.880
Yotsuba sends the problem!

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.750
<i>Don't worry, Jun.</i>

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:46.360
<i>I'll make up for it.</i>

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:53.300
<i>Yes! Got...</i>

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:01.520
She finishes!

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.950
Yotsuba sends the problem in one go!

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:29.610
<b><i>Iwakakeru!</i></b>

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:40.510
<b><i> Wall 8           Tears of Disappointment</i></b>

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:43.580
What's the matter with Yotsuba?

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:45.500
She hasn't moved for a while.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:48.070
All she has to do is 
reach for the third hold.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:50.580
<i>I did my middle finger.</i>

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:55.150
And that's time up!

00:02:56.650 --> 00:03:00.320
Yotsuba couldn't secure 
the hold in Problem C.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:04.360
She seemed like a different person 
to the one who one-shot Problem B!

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:06.590
What could have gotten into her?

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:08.040
Sayo-chin...

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:17.050
<i>I can't believe I got hurt 
during a competition.</i>

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:22.410
<i>I don't feel any pain.</i>

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.680
<i>It's likely a light tear,</i>

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:28.930
<i>which will heal in a couple of 
weeks if I'm careful with it.</i>

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:33.440
<i>That's the problem. I need to 
be careful with it starting </i>now.<i></i>

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:38.910
<i>I get it.</i>

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:41.200
<i>I know I shouldn't be climbing in this state.</i>

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:46.810
<i>But if I stop now, the two sends I made
 might not be enough to qualify for the finals.</i>

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:51.710
<i>We need at least one more 
member in the finals,</i>

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.310
<i>or it'll be difficult for Hanamiya to win.</i>

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:00.590
<i>Now that I've taped it up, I can 
do better than my last attempt.</i>

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:04.890
<i>I need to flash this problem 
before the pain arrives.</i>

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:06.340
<i>That's the best way!</i>

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:12.640
Oh, what? Yotsuba's stopped 
in her tracks again!

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:20.650
<i>Yeah, I guess this is as far as I go.</i>

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:23.530
<i>Sorry, girls.</i>

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:38.000
Whoa, look at Yotsuba!

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:40.160
She's moving again!

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:42.350
You can see her tenacity.

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:43.380
That said...

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.220
<i>Miss Yotsuba...</i>

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:48.640
<i>What you're trying to do 
comes at a heavy price.</i>

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:54.890
<i>I know that I should stop 
climbing now. I </i>want<i> to stop.</i>

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:57.270
<i>But you know what?</i>

00:04:57.270 --> 00:05:02.400
<i>I want to ease your concerns 
even more than that.</i>

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.670
<i>So, smile for me, Nono.</i>

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:06.100
<i>Sayo-chin...</i>

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:08.780
<i>Let me show you...</i>

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:12.170
<i>how unbeatable I am!</i>

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:15.470
<i>She's asking for cheers?</i>

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:17.120
Is Yotsuba just...

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.370
Is she playing to the crowd?

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:22.000
Wow! She's indomitable, and she knows it!

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:26.310
<i>To reach the top, I need 
your voices backing me up.</i>

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:27.890
<i>So, please.</i>

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:35.780
If that's what you want, Sayo-chin...

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:44.020
Go, Sayo-chin!

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:52.910
Go, Sayo-chin!

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:49.160
Go!

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.450
Go, go!

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:52.910
Captain!

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:54.830
Go!

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.830
Go!

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.710
Sayo-chin!

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:02.090
Go!

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:03.520
Go!

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:05.110
Go!

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:06.480
You've got it!

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:07.470
Go!

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.050
You're almost there!

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.160
Keep going!

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:11.850
Yeah, yeah!

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:12.540
Go!

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.580
Listen to that crowd!

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.450
The gym is shaking!

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:20.460
This is it!

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:22.520
The beautiful rumbling of resonance!

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:25.730
We're witnessing the miraculous moment 
when climber and crowd become one!

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:31.870
<i>Sure, this version of climbing is completely 
different than what I'm aiming for.</i>

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:32.910
<i>But...</i>

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:35.480
You can do it!

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.340
You can do it, Sayo-chin.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.760
Sayo-chin!

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.840
Y... Yo...

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:46.960
Go, go! You can do it!

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:47.200
You can do it, Yotsuba-san!

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:48.510
Sayo-chin!

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:48.510
Hang in there!

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.510
<i>She's paying the price to 
experience this moment?</i>

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.260
<i>It's giving me goosebumps.</i>

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:55.220
Yotsuba-san!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.950
Go!

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:00.390
Thank you all.

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:05.150
<i>All that's left is to aim for the top!</i>

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:21.040
She's done it!

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:27.530
Yotsuba sends the problem!

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:30.460
Things looked tough for her at one point,

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:33.510
but she used the audience's 
support to finish!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:37.000
Thank you so much, everyone!

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:41.320
<i>She's so good... Hanamiya's 
captain, Yotsuba Sayo.</i>

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:43.740
<i>She used the pressure to 
fuel herself and finished.</i>

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:47.150
Iwamine sends it in one!

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.340
She has cleared all four semifinal problems!

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:50.520
Yes, yes!

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:54.890
That ends the semifinals!

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:57.780
Who will be the six climbers 
to proceed to the finals?

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:59.530
Jun-chan!

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:00.790
Jun-chan?

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.790
Jun-chan...

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:03.860
Konomi-san.

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.470
Jun isn't here.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.000
Give her space for now.

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:11.760
The results are up!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:14.010
<b>High School Kanto Bouldering Championship Girls' Semifinals</b>

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:14.010
<b> Ranking  NO  Name                          Sends   Attempts    Zones   Attempts</b>

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:16.850
<b> Iwamine Chinari

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:17.390
Kurikawa takes the top two spots! 
They're strong!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.270
Is the team championship 
a foregone conclusion?

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:22.780
Fujita finishes fifth.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:25.470
The most surprising name, however...

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.020
<b>Kasahara Konomi</b>

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:28.830
Kasahara Konomi, a rookie, 
is in fourth place!

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:31.060
She's finished above Fujita!

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:35.080
She put on a real show here today!

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:38.910
I'm... in the finals?

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.790
That's an amazing result, Konomi-san.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:46.570
With our rankings, we have a real 
shot at the team championship.

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:47.720
Let's both do our best.

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:49.140
No, Sayo-chin!

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:53.100
You're hurt! Absolutely no more climbing!

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:54.580
Huh? Hurt?

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:56.680
Call it quits here this time.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.280
But Nono...

00:08:58.280 --> 00:08:59.560
No buts!

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:03.530
You pushed yourself back there 
to reassure me, didn't you?

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:04.940
I can tell!

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.810
No more!

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:09.440
I don't expect you to 
compete through an injury.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.690
That's the last thing I want!

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:13.860
Um...

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:16.460
Fine.

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:20.560
I'll withdraw from the finals, as Nono says.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:21.700
Captain...

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:26.580
I'm terribly sorry to make you take such 
a big stage all by yourself, Konomi-san,

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:29.180
but you're going to represent Hanamiya.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:34.090
The team championship is out of reach, 
but you can go for individual glory.

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:37.420
Do your best and see how far you can go.

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:39.350
G-Got it!

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:43.850
<i>But...</i>

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:47.580
<i>We've all worked so hard in order 
to win the team championship.</i>

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.160
<i>I don't want to give up on it yet.</i>

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:51.900
<i>I can't!</i>

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:55.400
<i>Hanamiya's still gonna 
take home the team crown!</i>

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.720
Yes, yes, yes...

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.660
Good day, Kasahara-san.

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:07.790
You had a truly lovely look 
on your face as you climbed.

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:11.940
As I thought,

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:16.420
you'll make for a feast unlike any other.

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:17.130
Wha...

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:19.710
What do you mean, feast?!

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:20.970
A delicious treat.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:23.520
I... I am not edible!

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:24.700
Be seeing you!

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:26.100
Toodles.

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:34.170
<i>Fifth in the semifinals,</i>

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:38.570
<i>and Iwamine-san, who I considered my rival,
 isn't even thinking about me now.</i>

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:43.660
<i>She's way more interested 
in the rookie who beat me.</i>

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:47.660
Why? Why am I like this?

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:51.740
If I can't deliver in the clutch, I'm just...

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:55.050
I'm just a pink elephant!

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:58.220
How can I call myself the team's captain?

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:00.390
You mean white elephant.

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:04.600
That's the phrase you were looking for.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:06.020
Rina.

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:08.270
And you're wrong.

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:11.540
You're no white elephant.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:18.110
Captain Masumin!

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:20.560
We looked all over for you!

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:23.100
Congratulations on making the finals!

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:26.870
You tackled those crazy-hard 
problems and actually qualified!

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:29.710
That's our Captain Masumin!

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:34.210
I'm certain you'll dominate the finals.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.320
Captain Masumin!

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:37.590
Captain Masumin.

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:42.910
Niijima fails to finish 
on her ninth attempt, too!

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:47.130
These final problems are so tough. But...

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:48.520
Never give...

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:51.280
Ah, she couldn't get in a tenth attempt.

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:51.980
Oops...

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:56.880
Now, next up is fifth place from the semis,

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:59.610
Caterno's ace, Fujita Masumi.

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.970
I've kept you waiting, Caterno.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:06.030
I have one goal: victory!

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:12.560
Fujita didn't perform to her 
lofty standards in the semis.

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:15.460
How will she climb in the finals?

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:19.050
<i>Watch me, guys.</i>

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:21.050
<i>This is my...</i>

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:23.800
<i>Fujita Masumi brand of climbing!</i>

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:29.850
So fast! It's almost like 
she's speed climbing!

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:33.100
Has Fujita regained her usual touch?

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:35.980
<i>I'd gotten it all wrong in my head.</i>

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:40.860
<i>I kept telling myself I had 
to live up to expectations...</i>

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:42.860
<i>Paralyzing myself with fear!</i>

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.240
So fast!

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:46.920
Too fast!

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:49.310
Fujita's already just one 
move away from the top!

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:51.880
No, two moves away.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:55.620
<i>But the team set me straight.</i>

00:12:56.030 --> 00:13:00.000
<i>They told me how wrong I was, 
that I didn't need to be scared...</i>

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:02.510
<i>And I'll trust them!</i>

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:07.350
<i>Nothing scares me anymore!</i>

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:09.640
Wha...

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.300
Sh-She sends it!

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:22.910
This route requires two moves from there,
 but she only needed one!

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:26.620
The springs on this girl! She lives up 
to her moniker of Black Panther!

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:27.780
Hell yeah!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:33.040
Th-That's not the right 
move... It's not beautiful...

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.610
but I still found myself entranced!

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:38.170
How I have failed myself!

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:39.630
Captain Masumin!

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:40.880
Way to go!

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.290
So cool!

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:42.170
We love you!

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:47.550
The tramp...

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:50.060
The tramp is here!

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:54.010
I think you mean "the champ is here."

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.060
The tramp champ is here

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:57.770
Why is she always such a dumbass?

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:02.900
The Captain Masumin we love is heroic 
and a little bit of an airhead.

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:06.590
Even when she's hurting, she never 
shows it and gives it her all.

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:08.530
We've all noticed, though.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:11.710
That's precisely why we 
can trust her to lead us.

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:12.530
Bingo.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.800
<i>Kasahara-san.</i>

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:21.550
<i>I may have lost to you,</i>

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:24.800
<i>but know that </i>we<i> aren't down and out yet.</i>

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:29.930
Next up is fourth place from 
the semis, Kasahara Konomi.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:32.880
Listen to those cheers.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:36.110
Her performance in the semis 
must've really made an impression.

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:36.990
In the finals—

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:39.420
Kasahara's in her element here!

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:43.910
Because the finals follow 
the World Cup finals format!

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:47.850
All climbers have already 
seen the problems beforehand,

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:51.920
so there's no need to be worried 
about losing time analyzing them.

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:57.720
So, Kasahara Konomi, an on-sight climber 
who can one-shot routes she can analyze,

00:14:57.720 --> 00:15:00.040
couldn't be more suited to the format!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:01.080
In other words,

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:01.420
Okay, okay.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.750
she's my favorite to win!

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:02.750
Calm down, Nakata-san!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.470
I wonder how she'll do this time.

00:15:05.470 --> 00:15:08.040
She might one-shot again, she might!

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:09.970
We certainly know she can.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:13.260
Good luck, Konomin!

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:13.720
Good luck, Master!

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:16.600
Let's see how this plays out.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:22.480
<i>I'm done with the analytic process.</i>

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:25.700
<i>I've conquered all these problems in my mind.</i>

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:32.160
<i>Watch me, Captain, Nono-san...</i>

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:34.570
<i>And Jun-chan.</i>

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:35.580
<i>I...</i>

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:39.080
<i>I'm going to lead Hanamiya to victory...</i>

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.380
Huh?

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.210
Aw...

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:51.740
Anne-chan, it's time to go.

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:53.260
Aw!

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:55.210
But that was fun.

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:57.930
Later, everyone. Stay Cool, Kurusu.

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:59.270
Cool, Kurusu!

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:01.620
Wait...

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:03.750
What?

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:10.400
We're ready to begin the Kanto Bouldering 
Championships' awards ceremony.

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:13.150
We begin with the individual championship.

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:17.120
In third place, Matsuhashi 
High's Niijima Kaoru!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:19.410
Dreams come true!

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:23.310
The runner-up is Kurikawa 
High's Iwamine Chinari.

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:24.920
I lost.

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:27.170
And our champion,

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:30.710
St. Caterno Girls' Fujita Masumi!

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:35.350
Captain Masumin!

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:40.460
Both Fujita and Iwamine 
sent all the problems,

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:43.310
but Fujita came out on 
top with fewer attempts.

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:43.310
Thank you, everyone!

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:48.220
She sure was on fire in the finals.

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:50.940
She seemed determined to 
one-shot everything in her way.

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:54.270
You could say she earned this 
victory through sheer willpower.

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:55.690
Beautiful...

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:59.290
In this moment, you girls are 
the very definition of beauty!

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:02.200
Is there anything that can 
surpass this glory? I say nay!

00:16:59.550 --> 00:17:02.200
Moving on, we present the team championship.

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:05.460
Our champion team...

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.330
Kurikawa High, it is!

00:17:08.780 --> 00:17:12.650
Having two climbers in the 
finals played a huge part.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:17.700
Now, let's get the thoughts of the 
individual climbers on the podium.

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:23.660
<i>Man, I didn't win us the team championship.</i>

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:30.760
<i>Why couldn't I climb at all back there?</i>

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:34.970
<i>I knew the right moves to make in my head,</i>

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:36.900
<i>but I couldn't do anything on the walls.</i>

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:42.560
<i>I have such a long way to go.</i>

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:45.740
<i>This is the real world of sport climbing.</i>

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:47.960
<i>And this is my reality.</i>

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:49.510
Man...

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:52.590
Guess I should've known.

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:03.100
Wrong!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.870
I wanna climb way more!

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.660
I can climb way more!

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:09.400
I <i>have</i> to!

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:11.900
I wanna be the best in Japan with the team!

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:13.900
<i>Jun-chan!</i>

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:17.900
<i>Jun-chan, I'll keep climbing.</i>

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:21.910
<i>Yeah, it'll be all right. 
Let's do our best together.</i>

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:24.410
Jun-chan!

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:27.900
Uh, where's Jun-chan?

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:32.380
She asked for time off from the team.

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:34.840
Time off?

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:35.990
Yes.

00:18:37.730 --> 00:18:43.240
Are you saying Jun-chan's leaving?

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:44.850
Not quite.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:47.100
A little before the closing ceremony...

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:51.270
Where is this coming from, Jun?

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:56.260
This competition helped me realize that 
I have a mental weakness in my game.

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:58.270
After thinking about it,

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:01.580
I figured I should take a 
long, hard look at how I climb

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:04.960
and decided to train by myself for a while.

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:08.160
But you can do that without 
time away from the team.

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:12.200
You don't have to distance yourself from us.

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:13.790
That simply won't work.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:15.360
Why not?

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:16.780
I'm sorry.

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:17.420
Hey...

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.460
Wait, Jun!

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:24.470
It's my fault.

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:28.470
I should've gone with her back then.

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:31.230
Wait, what? What are you talking about?

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:32.520
I did this...

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:35.680
Konomi-san, this was Jun's decision.

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:37.360
You shouldn't feel responsible.

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:41.390
But she's always helping me out,

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:43.490
and I couldn't do anything in the finals...

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:46.740
I doubt that was a factor, either.

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:50.340
Yeah, Jun wouldn't let that get to her.

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:55.250
There's just one thing we can say for sure.

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:57.880
Jun will come back to us...

00:19:58.850 --> 00:20:03.200
in time for the Combined Japan 
High School Cup in six months.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:06.510
The Combined Japan High School Cup?

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:10.410
Right. Lead, bouldering, speed...

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:13.020
In this national competition, climbers 
compete in all three disciplines.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:15.720
It has the same format as 
the world championships.

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:19.130
Indeed. And it is our ultimate goal.

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:24.430
If Jun doesn't come back by then, 
what'll we do for the team competition?

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:28.460
Relax. We can trust Jun to keep her word.

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:30.970
She'll find her answer and return, I know it.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:36.550
But we'll have no right to welcome 
her back if we remain as we are.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:40.110
Nono, in the next six months,

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:43.050
you need to absorb as much 
climbing knowledge as you can.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:48.810
If you could discern whether you had the 
advantage or not on a particular wall,

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:51.210
you would've fared very 
differently in this competition.

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:52.920
Yeah.

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:54.810
And, Konomi-san,

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:58.220
you're severely lacking in experience.

00:20:58.220 --> 00:21:02.180
In actual competition, the tension 
wears you out more than you realize.

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:06.080
That's just something 
you'll have to get used to,

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:10.200
so you'll enter every competition you can.

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:12.410
I...

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:14.900
Eyes up here, Konomi-san.

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:20.210
Do you want to keep hanging your head in 
shame when Jun's trying to hold hers high?

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:23.210
I'm certain you can get past 
this wall in your way, too.

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:27.220
I understand.

00:21:27.630 --> 00:21:31.880
I'll do everything I can 
over the next six months.

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:35.730
I'll make sure I have a real surprise in 
store for Jun-chan when she comes back.

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:38.280
That's the spirit.

00:21:38.280 --> 00:21:39.600
Let's do this.

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:40.990
For Jun-chan!

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:43.860
And for victory for Hanamiya!

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:48.490
Hanamiya High Climbing Team, 
aim for best in Japan.

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:50.730
Let's climb!

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:56.330
<i>I'll do my best!</i>

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:59.000
<i>So, wait for me, Jun-chan!</i>

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.060
<b><i>Iwakakeru!</i></b>

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.060
<b><i>Wall 9: The Princess of Climbing</i></b>
